body:
So far I have not actually managed to stay actually consistent! But the year has only 66 days left, so I am motivated to stay constant now and make the most of the rest of the year! 

The only thing I would wish for is customisable tasks. Right now there are only specific tasks available, but what is missing for me are some other fitness relevant things for example: 
&#34;Held up to diet/calorie count&#34; 
&#34;Burned calories&#34;
&#34;NO sugar&#34; 
Especially the last one. Because I dont smoke or drink, but being sugar addicted is just as bad...
